🚧 Challenges Faced During Development

Some challenges encountered during development included:

Preventing duplicate pricing calculations
Managing polymorphism with interfaces
Organizing packages and project structure
Implementing inheritance correctly
Implementing receipt saving functionality
Handling input validation safely
Debugging order flow and pricing logic

These challenges improved debugging, problem-solving, and software design skills.

