The DELI-cious Sandwich Shop Application represents a complete Java capstone project demonstrating:

✅ Object-Oriented Programming
✅ Interfaces & Polymorphism
✅ Inheritance
✅ File Handling
✅ Validation
✅ Unit Testing
✅ Modular Architecture
✅ GitHub Project Organization
✅ Professional Software Development Practices

This project was built to simulate a realistic sandwich shop ordering system while applying real-world Java development concepts in a practical capstone environment.